WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.600
This is bad.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.160
The defense was barely holding up before this.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.950
If Carlos were to push further forward, we're done for.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:18.430
Zelberto and Carlos... They now have two points to initiate their attacks from.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.840
It's coming!

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:28.590
Listen up.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.720
There is only one issue here.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.720
Their best option... will be to pass the ball to Pepe.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.060
It's Pepe!

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.950
Th-They really did it!

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.950
Crap!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.320
I'm going.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.490
It's in!

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:42.500
Tsubaki!

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:47.830
That bastard actually scored!

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.520
That Tsubaki really has something in him!

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.840
He's not the team's No.7 for nothing!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.030
I was unmarked just now!

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.050
Why didn't you pass it to me?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:43.190
Why did you pass it to Pepe who was clearly being marked?

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:46.250
Are you listening, Carlos?!

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.040
Stop it.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.000
Don't dwell on that incident anymore, Itagaki.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.110
Don't screw with me!

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.800
What did Itagaki say just now?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:05.190
Erm... Apparently you should have passed the ball to him instead?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.150
Carlos again?

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.770
He's gonna shoot!

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.400
Carlos!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.990
It's Pepe!

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.470
I was unmarked, yet they didn't pass it to me...

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:35.090
I'm not even considered a forward anymore.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.480
Dammit!

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:46.390
It has nothing to do with being on the right or left side anymore!

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.160
I'll just aim for the goal and shoot!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.060
That should be the way.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.820
That is how a forward should be.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.420
Tsubaki's excellent!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.680
That's right.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.950
I was surprised too.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:20.650
He was able to move upfield with that kind of speed; that alone is very impressive...

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.760
But to think he could score too...

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:29.850
Furthermore, Tsubaki's defending has been brilliant throughout the match.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:36.250
1-0... Are we able to hold on till the end?

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.200
Who knows?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:42.180
I don't think we can maintain our advantage till the end though.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:43.990
Then that's a problem!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.700
I feel that Nagoya will regroup and try to equalize,

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:53.370
but our players are concentrating and defending well.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.720
The next goal...

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.730
The next goal will be a crucial one.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:00.800
Yeah.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.750
No.7... He sure can run.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:11.640
Hey, Carlos!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.390
Fifteen minutes left.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.930
We have to find a way through!

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.400
Pass it to me!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:22.900
Time's running out!

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.920
I like that expression on your face.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:34.660
Didn't I make it clear that you can't beat me, Itagaki?!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:37.600
Silence!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.280
Shut up already!

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.540
I have to shoot!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.960
I won't score if I don't shoot!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.020
He took a shot!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.800
They're starting to pile on their shots!

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.520
Calm down and cover up the goal!

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.180
That's it, Itagaki.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:05.630
Stop trying to take them on.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.410
No one will fear a striker who doesn't shoot.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.680
The second ball!

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:16.750
Hey!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.360
Damn!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:23.520
Shoot!

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.440
I need to shoot!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.120
Very good, Itagaki.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:56.210
What annoys the defense the most... is someone who only has an eye for goal.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:59.750
The Japanese hardly think like that.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:05.840
Itagaki, if you're able to get yourself to the next level...

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.920
and be able to play in sync with the Brazilian Trio,

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:16.530
This team will certainly have the best offense in the league.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:26.020
We can't lose to a team like ETU, which uses tactics like counter-attacks.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.370
Nice, Dori!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.400
Push the defense line up!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.390
Alright!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.790
Nice, Tsubaki!

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.510
Damn!

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:52.150
I have to score this time!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.400
Take this!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.620
Nice, Ishihama!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:01.870
Ishihama!

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:02.870
Tsubaki!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:05.960
Forget it!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.020
Go, Tsubaki!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:49.530
I can see it.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.730
The pitch,

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:53.480
the ball,

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:56.200
even the fans...

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.750
I can see them clearly!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.930
That kid...!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.930
Wait, Zelberto! Mark No.10!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.690
The opponent's attacks all go through No.10!

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.690
Carlos...

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:14.940
You prepare for the counter, Zelberto!

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:22.380
If you're coming at me directly, I'll definitely stop you.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.200
Stop him, Carlos!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.810
Tsubaki... He's fast!

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.850
Find space, Sera!

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.300
This is our chance!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.380
Push up!

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.590
The coaches are yelling...

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:42.170
I was never able to notice it during the past matches.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.470
Why?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.770
Matches against the two top teams are special.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:55.110
A player like you would need long hours of practice to get used to them; that's no surprise.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.860
That's right... Murakoshi mentioned it to me before.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.990
You should be able to see things that were previously oblivious to you.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.970
Am I starting to get used to it?

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:19.490
Things that are oblivious to me... Was he referring to this?

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.260
Go, Tsubaki!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.260
Carlos!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.260
Alright!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.360
Go, go!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.770
Let them see what you have, Tsubaki!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.270
Your potential!

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:44.740
He's smiling?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:47.660
What?!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.400
He got past him!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.170
He's unstoppable!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.670
Yeah, Tsubaki!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.400
Go! Go! Go!
Yeah, Tsubaki!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.170
Go! Go! Go!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:02.290
He dribbled past Carlos with just one move!

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.140
What's up with this guy?

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.560
No.10!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.310
Defense, go!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.190
Quit underestimating us!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:17.570
Two of them!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.080
You did well, Baki.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.230
Yes!!

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:50.580
Goal!!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.590
Yeah!!

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.760
We're out of time!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:01.230
Defense, push up!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.620
Keep your focus guys! Concentrate!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.570
Our first win this season!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:43.900
Did you see that, Fuwa?!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.280
Yes!!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.910
Manager!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:56.910
Alright!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.770
Finally, our first win.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:15.790
Though it's still only 3 points,

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.410
we're able to suppress a rampant Nagoya and keep a clean sheet.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.190
Our defense should be brimming with confidence now.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:27.700
This win is a giant step for us, Murakoshi.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.540
I know that, Dori.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:36.700
It truly starts now.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.000
We'll restore our former glory!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:46.430
Good work!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:50.210
Yo!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.600
Looks like I've won this time, Itagaki.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.800
I didn't lose to you.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.860
What a sore loser!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:06.680
My performance today is self-destructive.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.910
If I don't start giving it my all,

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.640
I could be warming the bench soon!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:21.450
That bastard, he was hard to defend against towards the end.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:27.150
Thank you, Tatsumi.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.290
We lost convincingly.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:33.760
Thanks to you, I was able to see the areas we need to rectify on.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.640
That's good to know.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.640
I'll see you at our next match, then.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:46.650
Goodbye!

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.840
Brag all you can now.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:56.390
To you people, this might be an important victory...

00:16:56.390 --> 00:17:00.310
But to us, it's just a blip.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:04.360
Tactics that focus on the opponent's weaknesses...

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:08.100
only work in tournaments with knockout rounds.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.420
It won't work in the league every time.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.510
In the end, the score will be settled

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.350
by the team as a whole, including the management.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.430
That is a team's true strength.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:30.130
Can a superficial team like ETU survive by the end of the season?

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.200
If you're not going to accept the fact that you've lost,

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.830
you might just slip and fall again embarrassingly one day, Fuwa.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:48.000
What did he just say?

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.960
What's wrong?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.430
It seems that he doesn't want to answer me.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.650
Well, that's fine.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:02.410
Now that we've played, I've actually found other weaknesses in their team.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:06.980
Plus, it looks like our team will continue to grow from here on out.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:11.630
I'm gonna trounce them the next time we play.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.070
We won!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.410
We won a game with me in the team.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.310
And I scored a goal too.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.720
It's like a dream come true.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.260
Found him!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:37.010
Tsubaki, over here!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.180
They're back!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.510
What is wrong with them?!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.180
They look pretty pissed.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:50.520
Well, I guess it's natural for them to be mad after losing.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.690
Tsubaki, I heard from Carlos.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.510
You were enjoying yourself out there just now.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.780
You were still smiling when you played.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:05.360
Don't they realize that we can't understand each other?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.290
Though we're upset with losing,

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:12.920
only those who enjoy their football the most will win.

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:19.890
You've earned our respect, Tsubaki.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:23.640
You must be the one who enjoyed your football most today.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.560
That's why...

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.570
We would like you to exchange jerseys with one of us!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:42.450
Come, pick one!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.240
Come!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:55.340
You're cunning, Pepe! Bribing him with curry bun...

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.380
How did you sneak that in here anyway?

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.610
They're scary!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.090
I've had enough!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.350
What? It's not me? How sad.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.060
Baki.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.730
You're needed.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:16.220
Hooray!

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.230
Look at that, Shige!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.990
Tsubaki's the Man of the Match today!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.000
Well, he was the best player out there today...

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.000
considering the fact that he's usually unreliable.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.430
First, let's recall the first goal.

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:37.330
Erm... well. Uhh....

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.690
The ball just happened to roll towards me...

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.510
Yes?

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.390
So I had to do something...

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:48.020
Yes.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:51.520
What was that? He's stuttering!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:56.260
Tsubaki, though he's a totally different player from Tatsumi,

00:20:56.260 --> 00:21:00.140
he's still able to provide the same excitement!

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:03.400
Shige,

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:05.700
I'm going to do it.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.340
I'm really going to do it.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:09.770
Yuuji and Kacchan, let's do it!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:13.540
Let's get the fans back, and reform our cheering team!

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.280
How was the match, Mr. Kudo?

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:24.100
That's classified information.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.350
Huh?

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:41.530
Tsubaki.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:42.820
Yes?

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.470
Go and greet the fans.

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:32.150
Great work.

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:17.890
The Edomae army is back!

00:24:17.890 --> 00:24:19.480
Get the ball moving!

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:21.310
Go!

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:23.020
You're too slow!

00:24:23.270 --> 00:24:25.230
We're still among the weakest.

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:27.740
This is not the time to get complacent!
